WEBVTT

00:03.460 --> 00:08.500
<b>Hello? Is there anybody who can still move?!</b>

00:09.460 --> 00:11.920
<b>We've wiped out their main force.</b>

00:12.630 --> 00:15.880
<b>All they have left now are the King and Vana Freya!</b>

00:16.250 --> 00:20.830
<b>Master Bell is already fighting the King
and we'll keep Vana Freya busy.</b>

00:21.290 --> 00:23.630
<b>So if you can still move, then go west!</b>

00:24.630 --> 00:27.500
<b>Please make a break for Lady Freya.</b>

00:28.130 --> 00:31.670
<b>This is our one and only chance! There's no better time!</b>

00:32.920 --> 00:35.000
<b>Somebody nab her flower.</b>

00:35.670 --> 00:36.830
<b>Please!</b>

00:37.460 --> 00:40.080
<b>Somebody go after their Goddess!</b>

00:52.500 --> 00:53.380
<b>Hedin!</b>

00:58.210 --> 00:59.710
<b>What do you think you're doing?</b>

01:00.380 --> 01:03.710
<b>How could you betray Lady Freya like this?!</b>

01:06.210 --> 01:11.250
<b>Kyou no story toki ni yo wa irony</b>

01:11.500 --> 01:15.380
<b>"Soredemo..." tte kokoro ni</b>

01:15.380 --> 01:20.960
<b>Mitsuke dashita bokura no sekai</b>

01:30.380 --> 01:35.830
<b>Ano hi kara koko ni iru motome tsuzuke sagashiteru</b>

01:36.080 --> 01:42.630
<b>Yowasa ni deau tabi ikutsumo ikutsumo koenakucha</b>

01:42.630 --> 01:46.670
<b>Sono tabi ni namida o koraete wa</b>

01:46.920 --> 01:51.710
<b>Tachiagatte asu asatte sou yattekita no sa</b>

01:51.880 --> 01:57.000
<b>Kore made o shinjite susunda sono saki de</b>

01:57.170 --> 02:01.960
<b>Kakegaenonai mono bokura o matsu</b>

02:02.170 --> 02:06.630
<b>Bouken no story hajimari wa kyou de ii</b>

02:06.920 --> 02:12.710
<b>Itamashii elegy dare mo utawanuyou ni</b>

02:13.080 --> 02:17.580
<b>Aa tsuyoku naritai hangeki no hajimari</b>

02:17.710 --> 02:21.130
<b>Kakkowarukute ii</b>

02:21.500 --> 02:27.250
<b>Aa deai ga ai soko ni itanda ne</b>

02:36.080 --> 02:40.080
<b>Einherjar</b>

02:36.080 --> 02:40.080
<b>The Warriors of the Goddess</b>

02:36.750 --> 02:38.670
<b>Don't tell me you've forgotten, Hedin?!</b>

02:39.330 --> 02:41.540
<b>When we were on Hjathning...</b>

02:41.790 --> 02:47.420
<b>the one who saved us from the never-ending battle on
that accursed island was none other than Lady Freya!</b>

02:48.040 --> 02:51.500
<b>And now... you stab her in the back?!</b>

03:01.460 --> 03:03.330
<b>Don't push your luck, fool!</b>

03:04.250 --> 03:09.170
<b>You got completely wrecked by that whelp of an elf!
You have no right to give me any lip!</b>

03:04.420 --> 03:10.290
<b>Wait, stop! Cut it out! Why do you gotta be like this Hedin?</b>

03:09.500 --> 03:13.080
<b>Besides, you don't stand a chance
in hell against me right now!</b>

03:10.290 --> 03:13.460
<b>Ow! S-stop! Please!</b>

03:15.790 --> 03:18.460
<b>Do you really have to ask why I'm doing this?</b>

03:19.040 --> 03:23.130
<b>It's because that harebrain is
the only one who can save Lady Freya.</b>

03:24.750 --> 03:27.460
<b>That's what I've been training him for this whole time.</b>

03:27.920 --> 03:31.540
<b>And I tinkered with things to keep him from
getting swallowed up by her sandbox.</b>

03:33.250 --> 03:35.210
<b>There is no future beyond love.</b>

03:36.170 --> 03:39.580
<b>Her Ladyship's wish can never
be granted through divine love.</b>

03:40.000 --> 03:41.920
<b>You're not making any sense, Hedin!</b>

03:42.250 --> 03:44.380
<b>It's time for you to quit playing dumb!</b>

03:45.460 --> 03:47.210
<b>You must have realized by now.</b>

03:47.670 --> 03:50.080
<b>She chose him above any other man.</b>

03:50.710 --> 03:52.500
<b>Thus, we must rally behind him.</b>

03:51.710 --> 03:53.790
<b>But can't we just protect her instead?</b>

03:54.000 --> 03:56.330
<b>And be her loyal servants like we always have!</b>

03:56.330 --> 03:57.830
<b>Wake up and face reality!</b>

03:58.250 --> 04:00.330
<b>It doesn't matter how fiercely we protect her!</b>

04:00.630 --> 04:02.380
<b>Because that WON'T be her salvation!</b>

04:03.330 --> 04:05.290
<b>Quit pretending and speak your mind!</b>

04:05.630 --> 04:08.580
<b>Admit that you don't want to let some other man
lay claim to your beloved Goddess!</b>

04:10.630 --> 04:11.750
<b>I feel the same.</b>

04:12.000 --> 04:12.500
<b>Huh?</b>

04:13.420 --> 04:15.040
<b>What makes him so special?</b>

04:15.330 --> 04:17.250
<b>WHY CAN'T IT BE ME, DAMMIT?!</b>

04:17.250 --> 04:20.580
<b>I'VE ALWAYS WANTED TO BE HER SPECIAL SOMEONE!</b>

04:22.630 --> 04:24.540
<b>But it's not meant to be.</b>

04:25.250 --> 04:31.540
<b>We worship her as a Goddess and yearn for
her divine love. That makes us unable to truly save her.</b>

04:32.330 --> 04:37.630
<b>Because the more she tries to fill the role of "Goddess of
Love", the harder it becomes to grant her wish.</b>

04:39.630 --> 04:44.040
<b>If you can find it in yourself to believe my nonsense,
then pick up your sword!</b>

04:44.380 --> 04:48.500
<b>She needs us! We must free her from
the shackles of Goddesshood!</b>

04:49.170 --> 04:51.920
<b>Okay, I'll take your bait, Hedin.</b>

04:53.170 --> 04:57.130
<b>I can never figure out the right answer
because I'm too stupid.</b>

04:58.080 --> 05:00.790
<b>I'm a piece of trash who just lets others decide my fate.</b>

05:01.540 --> 05:02.420
<b>But y'know...</b>

05:02.830 --> 05:07.670
<b>Even I noticed how happy
Ms. Syr looked when she smiled.</b>

05:08.540 --> 05:10.500
<b>So, I'll buy into your nonsense.</b>

05:11.210 --> 05:14.830
<b>Because I don't want her to ever lose that smile.</b>

05:17.330 --> 05:19.210
<b>What's the big idea, you idiot?!</b>

05:19.580 --> 05:21.790
<b>I warned you what would happen if you got in our way!</b>

05:23.670 --> 05:24.580
<b>Anya!</b>

05:25.330 --> 05:26.380
<b>Let's get moving, Chloe!</b>

05:28.250 --> 05:30.210
<b>Not on... my watch...</b>

05:32.580 --> 05:35.750
<b>As long as the Bringar still live,</b>

05:36.380 --> 05:40.040
<b>then you'll never get within a foot of Lady Freya!</b>

05:41.210 --> 05:43.210
<b>Never again.</b>

05:53.920 --> 05:58.000
<b>I swear I'm never going to let her be defiled again!</b>

05:59.380 --> 06:02.330
<b>Listen, Big Brother! I'm trying tabby
a good friend and save Syr!</b>

06:02.500 --> 06:05.250
<b>Just like you always did fur me when I was little!</b>

06:06.130 --> 06:07.500
<b>Shut up, idiot!</b>

06:09.540 --> 06:10.670
<b>Sorry to butt in.</b>

06:12.210 --> 06:14.500
<b>Master Hogni? But why?</b>

06:15.330 --> 06:16.630
<b>The same reason as you.</b>

06:17.170 --> 06:19.420
<b>I've come around to the idea of saving Ms. Syr.</b>

06:19.710 --> 06:21.960
<b>Hogni! What the hell are you doing?!</b>

06:22.130 --> 06:24.250
<b>You're mad at me. That figures.</b>

06:24.630 --> 06:27.130
<b>My bad, Allen. Sorry for being trash.</b>

06:27.580 --> 06:29.580
<b>And sorry that I let Hedin fool me.</b>

06:31.420 --> 06:35.630
<b>But listen, I honestly think Ms. Syr's smile
is too precious to lose!</b>

06:36.290 --> 06:39.630
<b>So I'm siding with Hedin and putting all my bets on Bell.</b>

06:40.130 --> 06:42.460
<b>I want to help set Her Ladyship free!</b>

06:46.580 --> 06:49.040
<b>You've all lost your friggin' minds!</b>

06:49.670 --> 06:51.790
<b>Both you and that damn snake!</b>

06:52.080 --> 06:55.500
<b>I didn't pledge my service to that stupid townsgirl!</b>

06:56.170 --> 07:00.500
<b>I obeyed the Goddess because
she promised me power in return!</b>

07:01.170 --> 07:06.000
<b>All I want is for Her Ladyship to continue being
the almighty Goddess she's always been.</b>

07:06.540 --> 07:08.420
<b>THAT'S who stole my heart!</b>

07:08.420 --> 07:10.210
<b>The ruthless and domineering Goddess</b>

07:10.210 --> 07:12.500
<b>who wields more power than anyone else!</b>

07:13.830 --> 07:16.000
<b>You've all been blessed with her love...</b>

07:16.330 --> 07:18.080
<b>but unless you defeat me here,</b>

07:18.210 --> 07:20.040
<b>then I'm sending you to your graves!</b>

07:20.040 --> 07:21.630
<b>I can't even break his guard!</b>

07:23.000 --> 07:24.420
<b>He has no blind spots to take advantage of!</b>

07:27.710 --> 07:31.170
<b>Damn whippersnapper! How much training
did he do to get this tough?!</b>

07:31.540 --> 07:35.630
<b>Those without the power to defeat me
have no right to save the Goddess.</b>

07:36.920 --> 07:38.710
<b>Let alone the girl.</b>

07:51.170 --> 07:54.330
<b>"Merciful silver amid golden plains."</b>

07:55.330 --> 07:57.420
<b>Stop him! Right now!</b>

07:59.920 --> 08:02.170
<b>"I am the feral fighter ordained to the battlefield."</b>

08:02.170 --> 08:03.250
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

08:07.670 --> 08:09.250
<b>He's baiting us, but I've got no choice!</b>

08:10.290 --> 08:10.920
<b>Weakling.</b>

08:14.420 --> 08:15.290
<b>Mama Mia!</b>

08:26.330 --> 08:29.790
<b>"Wildly I charge, delivering Her divine will."</b>

08:30.330 --> 08:32.000
<b>Hildis Vini.</b>

08:33.460 --> 08:36.040
<b>Unless you can stop this, then say goodbye.</b>

08:42.750 --> 08:46.130
<b>Little Miss Supporter! Haruhime!</b>

08:46.500 --> 08:51.040
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.
Your Goddess of Victory is here to help!</b>

08:51.460 --> 08:54.210
<b>Now I can power you all up!</b>

08:54.210 --> 08:55.040
<b>Whoa...</b>

08:55.330 --> 08:57.210
<b>What a mess!</b>

08:57.630 --> 09:00.540
<b>You look like a used punching bag!
We gotta get you healed-</b>

09:00.540 --> 09:02.080
<b>No! That's not important!</b>

09:02.290 --> 09:05.000
<b>We need to focus on helping
the people who can still fight!</b>

09:05.210 --> 09:07.500
<b>Okay, well, at least let me power you up.</b>

09:07.500 --> 09:09.000
<b>I'll do a status update right no-</b>

09:09.000 --> 09:10.580
<b>We don't have the time!</b>

09:10.880 --> 09:13.330
<b>What are you even doing here in the first place?!</b>

09:13.330 --> 09:17.500
<b>Hey! Don't give me a hard time after
I ran my butt off to get here!</b>

09:17.880 --> 09:19.750
<b>I'm so glad you're okay, Master Miach!</b>

09:20.080 --> 09:21.290
<b>And I you, Naza!</b>

09:21.880 --> 09:23.830
<b>Why don't I get a warm welcome like that?!</b>

09:23.960 --> 09:25.960
<b>Because every family has their own traditions!</b>

09:26.130 --> 09:30.210
<b>More importantly, you should go with Lady Haruhime
to help Master Bell as soon as possible.</b>

09:30.580 --> 09:32.420
<b>We'll handle things here.</b>

09:32.920 --> 09:37.460
<b>Despite how close it's gotten, we still can't win
this War Game without beating the King!</b>

09:39.920 --> 09:41.790
<b>Can you still use Kokonoe?</b>

09:42.170 --> 09:44.920
<b>Say for three... no, four people at once?</b>

09:44.920 --> 09:47.330
<b>That's no problem. Consider it done!</b>

09:47.630 --> 09:51.170
<b>Great. Then once you get there,
give Lady Ryu and the others a Level Boost</b>

09:51.460 --> 09:54.040
<b>while Lady Hestia does a status update for Master Bell.</b>

09:54.170 --> 09:56.420
<b>That's our only shot at winning this thing!</b>

09:57.210 --> 09:58.170
<b>All right.</b>

09:59.130 --> 10:00.710
<b>Let's go, Haruhime.</b>

10:14.670 --> 10:17.630
<b>Guess I'm not as good at using this as Leon.</b>

10:21.250 --> 10:24.250
<b>Strike evermore, immortal lightning general.</b>

10:24.670 --> 10:26.000
<b>Valiant Hildr!</b>

10:35.830 --> 10:39.630
<b>How much of my Mind must I be forced
to waste just to divert one of your attacks?</b>

10:40.380 --> 10:42.330
<b>You grotesquely ludicrous brute.</b>

10:42.790 --> 10:44.500
<b>M-Master!</b>

10:45.210 --> 10:47.210
<b>It's getting juicy, folks!</b>

10:47.380 --> 10:50.040
<b>After Hildrsleif sided with the allied army,</b>

10:50.040 --> 10:52.830
<b>now he's going to clash with the King himself!</b>

10:53.170 --> 10:55.210
<b>It's a showdown of wit versus brawn!</b>

10:55.210 --> 10:57.290
<b>How is this gonna play out?</b>

10:58.170 --> 11:00.710
<b>Whoever's stronger will reign supreme!</b>

11:00.920 --> 11:03.920
<b>I AM GANESHA!</b>

11:06.670 --> 11:07.630
<b>Master...</b>

11:08.330 --> 11:10.250
<b>You're really going to fight with us?</b>

11:10.250 --> 11:13.130
<b>What else would I be here for, you inept gnat?</b>

11:13.290 --> 11:15.580
<b>Do you have a strategy to take down the King?</b>

11:15.750 --> 11:17.830
<b>Better question: why are you fighting without one?</b>

11:18.040 --> 11:19.540
<b>He's a literal monster.</b>

11:20.250 --> 11:23.540
<b>Would you morons consider going head-to-head
with a Floor Boss a smart move?</b>

11:24.880 --> 11:25.540
<b>Mia.</b>

11:26.250 --> 11:28.210
<b>I expected better of you.</b>

11:28.670 --> 11:31.290
<b>Oh, zip it. You know I'm outta practice!</b>

11:31.500 --> 11:33.580
<b>Then you better roll up your damn sleeves.</b>

11:34.420 --> 11:36.170
<b>I'm assuming you don't need my explanation.</b>

11:36.790 --> 11:37.580
<b>That's right.</b>

11:37.960 --> 11:39.460
<b>Let me ask you one thing.</b>

11:39.830 --> 11:42.080
<b>I provoked Hogni and the others</b>

11:42.250 --> 11:47.420
<b>into putting that harebrain on death's doorstep as part of
an extreme training course to make him a decent fighter.</b>

11:48.130 --> 11:51.250
<b>But you were the only one
who refused to follow my orders.</b>

11:53.580 --> 11:54.500
<b>Ottarl.</b>

11:54.500 --> 11:56.040
<b>We could use you, too.</b>

11:56.670 --> 11:59.630
<b>Adding me to the mix is too much. You can handle it.</b>

12:00.460 --> 12:05.960
<b>Were you already aware of my defection by then
and anticipated it would turn out like this?</b>

12:06.670 --> 12:09.080
<b>I'm not nearly as smart as you are.</b>

12:10.040 --> 12:12.580
<b>But in that moment, I was struck by a vision...</b>

12:13.540 --> 12:17.040
<b>where you all stood against me.</b>

12:17.710 --> 12:20.580
<b>Quit ruining all of my strategizing with your gut instincts.</b>

12:20.580 --> 12:21.880
<b>You damn musclehead.</b>

12:23.170 --> 12:25.790
<b>We're going to wipe you off the map now.</b>

12:27.670 --> 12:30.130
<b>Mia. Lead those two in another attack on him.</b>

12:30.130 --> 12:34.710
<b>We don't have the kind of teamwork needed
to keep up with someone like you right away.</b>

12:34.880 --> 12:37.000
<b>I wasn't expecting you to.</b>

12:37.460 --> 12:38.920
<b>Just buy me 10 seconds.</b>

12:38.920 --> 12:39.670
<b>Now go!</b>

12:40.790 --> 12:42.920
<b>Fight evermore, my immortal lightning warriors!</b>

12:42.920 --> 12:43.750
<b>Not happening!</b>

12:43.750 --> 12:45.670
<b>Don't count me out yet!</b>

12:49.750 --> 12:50.880
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

12:51.080 --> 12:52.460
<b>Agallis Arvesynth!</b>

12:58.170 --> 13:00.960
<b>That's all the time I need. Now for the pay off.</b>

13:05.960 --> 13:06.750
<b>Solia!</b>

13:12.080 --> 13:12.830
<b>I hit him!</b>

13:14.250 --> 13:14.880
<b>Sjau!</b>

13:21.290 --> 13:23.790
<b>That's a big oof!</b>

13:23.000 --> 13:23.790
<b>Holy crap!</b>

13:23.790 --> 13:25.000
<b>That must've hurt.</b>

13:25.000 --> 13:27.460
<b>Hot damn! They timed that perfectly.</b>

13:27.670 --> 13:32.630
<b>Hedin has even fined tuned the power and scale
of his spell to avoid dealing any damage to Bell's team.</b>

13:32.960 --> 13:35.670
<b>Ranged attacks that are coordinated
to hit alongside a vanguard</b>

13:35.670 --> 13:38.330
<b>are enough to create cracks in any defense.</b>

13:38.540 --> 13:40.830
<b>The combination of his magic and their attacks</b>

13:40.830 --> 13:43.750
<b>has forced the King to deal with too much at once!</b>

13:45.080 --> 13:45.710
<b>Tsk.</b>

13:46.000 --> 13:50.040
<b>Literally anybody could start kicking his ass
with a genius like that backing them up.</b>

13:50.830 --> 13:55.250
<b>Ottarl. I devised this formation for the express
purpose of taking you down one day.</b>

13:55.500 --> 13:58.710
<b>But since it was impossible to implement by myself,
I had abandoned the idea.</b>

13:59.170 --> 14:01.540
<b>Now is the perfect chance for me to reuse it.</b>

14:10.500 --> 14:12.290
<b>Call it quits already, dammit!</b>

14:12.500 --> 14:14.960
<b>You're really starting to test my friggin' patience!</b>

14:15.540 --> 14:17.750
<b>Hey, don't just pretend I'm not here.</b>

14:19.130 --> 14:20.080
<b>You sonnuva bitch!</b>

14:20.080 --> 14:21.500
<b>What's the matter, Allen?</b>

14:22.000 --> 14:24.130
<b>Your attacks don't have their usual bite to them today.</b>

14:24.580 --> 14:25.460
<b>Are you tired?</b>

14:25.710 --> 14:26.710
<b>What?!</b>

14:27.170 --> 14:28.420
<b>No, that can't be it.</b>

14:28.710 --> 14:31.330
<b>You just don't want to hurt your sweet little sister, huh?</b>

14:32.540 --> 14:35.500
<b>Don't give me that bullshit! Shut your damn mouth!</b>

14:35.920 --> 14:36.920
<b>Burn Dain!</b>

14:40.080 --> 14:41.500
<b>Thanks for proving my point.</b>

14:42.130 --> 14:44.170
<b>You wouldn't have walked right into that otherwise.</b>

14:44.380 --> 14:47.210
<b>Whatever, numbskull! Don't pretend you know me!</b>

14:47.630 --> 14:49.750
<b>Do you hate me, Big Brother?</b>

14:51.290 --> 14:52.540
<b>Yeah, obviously.</b>

14:53.330 --> 14:57.250
<b>I went to the Fólkvangr earlier,
and learned something impawtant...</b>

14:57.710 --> 14:59.170
<b>Get your claws off me!</b>

14:59.580 --> 15:02.380
<b>Both Syr and my brother threw meowt like garbage!</b>

15:02.750 --> 15:06.830
<b>My brother just has no felines for me at all!</b>

15:08.960 --> 15:11.130
<b>I really hate to admit this...</b>

15:12.040 --> 15:14.960
<b>but that friggin' cat and I have a lot in common.</b>

15:14.960 --> 15:15.630
<b>Huh?</b>

15:16.170 --> 15:19.000
<b>If he truly didn't care about you,
then you'd be dead already.</b>

15:19.630 --> 15:21.880
<b>So, the fact you're still alive can only mean...</b>

15:23.290 --> 15:27.500
<b>Did we really get sepurrated
because you hate me, Big Brother?</b>

15:27.750 --> 15:29.790
<b>What the hell are you trying to get at right n-?!</b>

15:29.790 --> 15:31.790
<b>Then why don't you just scratch me out?!</b>

15:33.000 --> 15:37.460
<b>You always say I'm going to suffur death!
But you never actually do it!</b>

15:38.500 --> 15:39.380
<b>Why?</b>

15:41.040 --> 15:41.960
<b>I get it.</b>

15:42.580 --> 15:45.630
<b>You could never abandon someone who you love.</b>

15:46.750 --> 15:48.540
<b>Shunning her was all you could do, right?</b>

15:50.710 --> 15:54.210
<b>Allen. I'm sorry to say this, but you've lost your edge.</b>

15:54.630 --> 15:55.880
<b>Hedin felt the same.</b>

15:56.420 --> 16:00.380
<b>After your sister left, he said you became
a spineless loser with nothing left to protect.</b>

16:00.830 --> 16:03.210
<b>And now he regrets not taking
the position of Vice-Captain.</b>

16:04.250 --> 16:05.250
<b>Big Brother...</b>

16:06.380 --> 16:10.000
<b>She's doomed to die if she stays
in the Fólkvangr any longer.</b>

16:10.540 --> 16:12.920
<b>So please... kick her out.</b>

16:13.880 --> 16:16.420
<b>I'll make up for that dummy by fighting harder.</b>

16:16.830 --> 16:18.250
<b>Let her find a place to belong</b>

16:19.040 --> 16:20.540
<b>that's not with me.</b>

16:22.330 --> 16:25.630
<b>Oh, Big Brother... you always cared about me...</b>

16:26.130 --> 16:27.380
<b>Fur this whole time...</b>

16:28.080 --> 16:31.460
<b>But I want to go back tabbying a family with everyone!</b>

16:31.960 --> 16:33.790
<b>With you and Syr!</b>

16:33.790 --> 16:34.960
<b>That's enough. Just shut up.</b>

16:36.630 --> 16:38.380
<b>I won't let the Goddess fall.</b>

16:39.210 --> 16:41.750
<b>My loyalty to her is what gives me power.</b>

16:42.500 --> 16:43.920
<b>It's part of our contract.</b>

16:44.460 --> 16:48.880
<b>And I won't stop fighting until I take down
the Black Dragon that ravaged our home.</b>

16:49.710 --> 16:53.790
<b>Because as long as that damn monster still exists,
your happiness can be shattered at any time.</b>

16:55.000 --> 16:59.290
<b>But I know you won't give up, you'll just keep
chasing me even as I head for the end of everything.</b>

16:59.290 --> 17:02.460
<b>So I'm left with no choice, if I want to protect you...</b>

17:02.830 --> 17:04.500
<b>then I'll have to friggin' kill you!</b>

17:05.540 --> 17:07.880
<b>"Golden wheel and silver collar."</b>

17:08.170 --> 17:10.710
<b>"Amidst scorning love and dead fantasies,"</b>

17:08.710 --> 17:10.130
<b>He's casting a spell!</b>

17:11.210 --> 17:12.540
<b>"here the Fates arrive."</b>

17:12.830 --> 17:16.420
<b>"Begone golden wheel, before the rutting tracks kill you."</b>

17:18.080 --> 17:20.880
<b>"With whip of glory and lips of affection,"</b>

17:20.880 --> 17:22.290
<b>"here the cost is paid."</b>

17:22.710 --> 17:26.170
<b>"Spin silver wheel, until the day mine head goes flying."</b>

17:26.580 --> 17:30.290
<b>"To beyond the Heavens,
where the poetic dreams of the wheels are heard."</b>

17:30.500 --> 17:34.170
<b>"Wildly I charge, delivering Her divine will."</b>

17:34.750 --> 17:36.960
<b>Gralineze Fromel!</b>

17:44.210 --> 17:45.080
<b>That's not good!</b>

17:45.080 --> 17:46.580
<b>Allen, is that you?!</b>

18:08.290 --> 18:12.420
<b>"Let traces of the stars be jot upon this land
such like they rip through the Heavens."</b>

18:13.080 --> 18:14.420
<b>"Justice is passed down."</b>

18:14.420 --> 18:15.920
<b>Now!</b>

18:15.920 --> 18:17.710
<b>Kaguya. Help me out.</b>

18:20.960 --> 18:22.000
<b>Gokoh!</b>

18:29.580 --> 18:30.920
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

18:31.080 --> 18:32.380
<b>Caelus Hildr!</b>

18:34.880 --> 18:37.750
<b>Strike evermore, immortal lightning general.</b>

18:37.920 --> 18:39.420
<b>Valiant Hildr!</b>

18:50.380 --> 18:51.630
<b>We got him!</b>

19:10.250 --> 19:11.500
<b>MASTER!</b>

19:23.380 --> 19:24.580
<b>What kind of power is that?!</b>

19:24.960 --> 19:26.130
<b>Beast mode.</b>

19:26.920 --> 19:29.290
<b>This is the King's real trump card.</b>

19:48.080 --> 19:50.710
<b>Kono himitsu shizume</b>

19:50.710 --> 19:53.170
<b>Yuredasu suimen ni</b>

19:53.580 --> 19:57.750
<b>Kizuku yochi ga atta mitai</b>

19:58.540 --> 20:05.210
<b>Umaku arawasenai sore de ite masshiro na omoi</b>

20:05.210 --> 20:08.380
<b>Yobeba mata hoshiku naru</b>

20:08.380 --> 20:13.380
<b>Hayaru kanjou sore wa uneru nami no you</b>

20:13.750 --> 20:18.960
<b>Chikutto sotto shirazu ni hareteku</b>

20:20.040 --> 20:26.580
<b>Soshite hedateta kabe kuzurete rikai shita kotoba wa</b>

20:26.710 --> 20:31.080
<b>Tada yuratto sora ni ukanderu</b>

20:31.580 --> 20:37.130
<b>Tatoe kara demo koeteku ai hoshii</b>

20:37.380 --> 20:42.710
<b>Douse yume nara uso mo tsuredashite</b>

20:42.710 --> 20:46.330
<b>Tatoe ubaenai sei demo</b>

20:46.460 --> 20:51.920
<b>Kokoro o sukoshi mitashite kawaru</b>

20:52.210 --> 20:57.880
<b>Memai no you na muku na kasumi</b>

21:21.540 --> 21:22.540
<b>Hedin.</b>

21:22.920 --> 21:25.880
<b>Is this really what you were hoping to accomplish?</b>

21:27.420 --> 21:28.920
<b>You tell me.</b>

21:29.710 --> 21:31.710
<b>How does this all look in your eyes?</b>

21:32.250 --> 21:33.290
<b>Unbecoming.</b>

21:34.630 --> 21:37.880
<b>You should have been able
to execute a much better strategy.</b>

21:37.880 --> 21:40.880
<b>Hah! You mean to win this stupid game?</b>

21:41.250 --> 21:43.920
<b>It could have ended the minute that I changed sides.</b>

21:44.420 --> 21:49.580
<b>Because all I had to do was go pluck
her flower with my own hands.</b>

21:50.880 --> 21:51.710
<b>Except...</b>

21:52.210 --> 21:54.000
<b>that would be pointless.</b>

21:54.880 --> 21:57.880
<b>Since that's NOT what my end goal is at all!</b>

21:58.670 --> 22:02.790
<b>Once upon a time, Her Ladyship
liberated me from the duty of being King!</b>

22:03.130 --> 22:08.290
<b>And now it's my turn! I'm going to bring her
down off the altar of Goddesshood!</b>

22:08.670 --> 22:10.290
<b>Are you aware of what's happening?!</b>

22:10.710 --> 22:14.630
<b>Our Goddess is being torn apart
by the very love that she's trying to obtain!</b>

22:15.000 --> 22:16.920
<b>Do you realize how she feels?!</b>

22:17.330 --> 22:19.380
<b>Despite cutting everyone off in the name of love,</b>

22:19.540 --> 22:23.130
<b>she's suffering like a heartbroken child
from her own lingering affection!</b>

22:23.500 --> 22:25.580
<b>Have you noticed how she looks?!</b>

22:25.920 --> 22:29.630
<b>Because even now, her cheeks are wet with tears!</b>

22:30.250 --> 22:32.920
<b>If you know all this, then how can you let it happen?!</b>

22:33.130 --> 22:36.380
<b>If we stand by and do nothing,
then those tears will NEVER stop!</b>

22:37.130 --> 22:39.960
<b>Someone must tarnish the sublimity of our Goddess!</b>

22:40.170 --> 22:42.380
<b>And make her give up this madness!</b>

22:43.790 --> 22:47.630
<b>Even if Lady Freya won't condone such a transgression?</b>

22:48.380 --> 22:52.830
<b>Who can claim to be her champion if they put
their own safety first?! That's not servility!</b>

22:53.420 --> 22:57.420
<b>Who can claim to be her devotee if they're afraid
of being hated?! That's not commitment!</b>

22:59.710 --> 23:02.710
<b>I offer her nothing but the purest form of loyalty!</b>

23:03.960 --> 23:05.130
<b>And that's why...</b>

23:05.880 --> 23:07.580
<b>You need to get lost!</b>

23:09.250 --> 23:10.580
<b>You should get lost!</b>

23:11.080 --> 23:12.580
<b>Get lost already!</b>

23:13.580 --> 23:15.130
<b>I will defeat you.</b>

23:15.580 --> 23:17.670
<b>You can't stop me from reaching Ms. Syr!</b>

23:18.460 --> 23:20.630
<b>You've been blessed with the love of a Goddess,</b>

23:20.960 --> 23:23.290
<b>yet you choose to reject it and oppose her?</b>

23:24.960 --> 23:25.830
<b>Fine, then.</b>

23:26.830 --> 23:27.920
<b>Bring it.</b>

23:29.460 --> 23:31.580
<b>This is going to be the end!</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:40.960
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:40.960
<b>Syr</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:40.960
<b>"First Love"</b>

23:37.290 --> 23:39.250
<b>Next time: "Syr."</b>
